### Sign up
POST http://localhost:5235/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aj",
  "email": "aj@example.com",
  "password": "SomeStrongPassword123!"
}


### Sign in — copy the returned token
POST http://localhost:5235/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aj@example.com",
  "password": "SomeStrongPassword123!"
}


### Use the token on a protected endpoint
GET http://localhost:5235/app/songs?title=There Will Be Blood
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Create a playlist
POST http://localhost:5235/app/songs/save?title=There Will Be Blood
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..7lK3vxUGzKM25MiRceKNLK-HLVq7BrSA2LY5ws6xGlY
